- Soil types and cashew cultivation techniques 
- Branch arrangement 
- Fertilizer use 
- Pesticide use 
- Harvesting 
- Cashew nut standards 
- Post-harvest techniques and flavoring', 'ឯកសារបច្ចេកទេសឬឃ្លីប វីដេអូស្ដីពីដី៖- ប្រភេទដី និងបច្ចេកទេសដាំដុះស្វាយចន្ទី', 'count', 'count_to_target', 'increase', 'if(${ind_001_value} != '''', round((${ind_001_value} div 7) * 100), '''')', 'annual', 'Ministry annual report (Kobo)', '2025-01-01', false),
